      <div class="view" id="view-cypher">
        <div class="cyph-phase" id="cyphPhaseLabel">Phase 2 of 4</div>
        <div class="page-head" style="margin-bottom:12px">
          <div class="eyebrow">Knowledge Graph — Cypher Detection</div>
          <div class="page-title" id="cyphPageTitle">Cypher Graph Traversal / Pattern Detection Engine</div>
          <div class="page-sub" id="cyphUseCaseLine">Preparing the active use-case traversal plan…</div>
          <div class="cyph-intro" id="cyphIntro">Cypher will select the most relevant sources, traverse significant graph paths, and write results only after each detection completes.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="cyph-raw-head" id="cyphRawTitle">PROMINENT STRUCTURED + UNSTRUCTURED SOURCES TARGETED BY CYPHER</div>
        <div class="cyph-raw-sub" id="cyphRawSubtitle">Use-case-specific sources selected for active Cypher detections will appear here.</div>
        <div class="cyph-raw-grid" id="cyphRawGrid">
          <div class="cyph-loading">Selecting prominent structured and unstructured sources…</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cyph-banner" id="cyphBanner">† Zero flags. Zero risk scores. SQL has nothing to query. GRAPHEN will now detect from the raw structure.</div>

        <div class="cyph-scenario-head">
          <span>Select a detection scenario and run it, or execute the complete plan sequentially.</span>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-run-all" id="cyphRunAllBtn" onclick="cyphRunAllDetections()">▶ Run All Detections</button>
        </div>
        <div class="cyph-scenarios" id="cyphScenarios"></div>

        <div class="cyph-workspace" id="cyphWorkspace" style="display:none">
          <div class="cyph-main">
            <div class="cyph-toolbar">
              <button type="button" onclick="cyphStepBack()" title="Previous step">⏮ Back</button>
              <button type="button" class="primary" id="cyphPlayBtn" onclick="cyphTogglePlay()">▶ Play</button>
              <button type="button" onclick="cyphStepForward()">Forward ⏭</button>
              <button type="button" onclick="cyphRestart()">↺ Restart</button>
              <div class="cyph-speed">
                <span>Speed</span>
                <input type="range" id="cyphSpeed" min="1" max="10" value="5" oninput="cyphUpdateSpeed()" />
              </div>
              <div class="cyph-progress">
                <span id="cyphHopMeta">Hop 0/0</span>
                <span id="cyphStepMeta">Step 0/0</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cyph-graph-area" id="cyphGraphArea">
              <svg id="cyphGraphSvg" width="100%" height="100%"></svg>
              <div class="cyph-popup" id="cyphPopup"></div>
              <div class="cyph-console" id="cyphConsole"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="cyph-path-panel">
              <div class="cyph-path-head">
                <span>Most Significant Relationship Path</span>
                <span id="cyphPathMeta">Select a detection</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cyph-path-wrap">
                <table class="cyph-path-table">
                  <thead>
                    <tr>
                      <th>#</th><th>Source</th><th>Relationship</th><th>Target</th>
                      <th>Hop</th><th>Score</th><th>Evidence</th><th>Result</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody id="cyphPathRows"></tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cyph-side">
            <div class="cyph-panel">
              <h4>Detection Run Result</h4>
              <div class="cyph-run-status" id="cyphRunStatus">READY · Select Run on a detection scenario</div>
              <div class="cyph-result-grid" id="cyphResultGrid"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="cyph-panel">
              <h4>Current Step</h4>
              <div class="cyph-narrative" id="cyphNarrative">Select a detection scenario to begin.</div>
              <div class="cyph-flags-box" id="cyphFlagsBox">FLAGS WRITTEN</div>
            </div>
            <div class="cyph-panel">
              <h4>Cypher — Line by Line Execution</h4>
              <div class="cyph-cypher-lines" id="cyphCypherLines"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="cyph-panel">
              <h4>Variable Bindings</h4>
              <div class="cyph-bindings" id="cyphBindings"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cyph-footer">
          <div class="struct-nav-left">
            <button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="nav('graph')">← Back</button>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="goToCrossDocDiscovery()">Next: Cross-Doc Discovery →</button>
          </div>
